@startuml ci-ontwerpdocument
' Activity diagram of the workflow Ontwerpdocument. Explanation: docs/deployment.md
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

start
:Pull request that changes docs/design,
push to main, or tag vX.Y.Z;
:Merge the chapters into one PDF
with Pandoc and Typst;
:Upload the PDF as a workflow artifact;
if (What started the run?) then (pull request)
  stop
elseif (push to main)
  :Replace the prerelease preview;
  stop
else (tag vX.Y.Z)
  :Publish the release vX.Y.Z;
  stop
endif
@enduml
